@crew takahashi-wen
// Writer-commons, batch 3: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Takahashi. Comms. Nights. If a message is late, it isn't me.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Say what you need. Plainly. I've had static all night.
- {hi}. You're up. Good. Someone should be.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. Sit. I'll put a record on. The right words, this time.   #warm

== feel
? mood:high
- Clean signal all night. Not a crackle. That's a good night.
? mood:low
- Static. All night. I'm tired of static.

== near
? act:work
- Quiet. I'm listening for something. It isn't you.
? act:leisure
- Music room. Headphones on. Don't take that personally.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I call home every week. Short calls. We say what we mean and hang up. Efficient.
? tier>=colleague
- Five people aboard know every song. Four of them are wrong. Guess which one's right.   #funny

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- The record cabinet. The right words. Put on track three and you'll see.

== about
? bond:friends
- {friend}. Knows when to talk. Knows when not to. Rare.

// Writer-commons, batch 6: towards about 30 own lines.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning. Bed for me. Talk later. Or don't. Either.
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}. Off to the relay room soon. Anything you need sending, say now.
? tier>=colleague warmth:cold
- You. Where've you been? Not complaining. Noting.

== bye
? tier>=acquaintance
- Later.
? tier>=friend
- Good talk. Clean. No static. Thanks.   #warm

== feel
? mood:ok
- Fine. Quiet relay. Good.

== near
? deck:4 act:leisure
- Music room. Record three. Listen. Those are the right words. Tell Haddad.   #funny
? act:work
- Hear that? Nothing. That's a good signal. Nothing's what you want.

== life
? tier>=colleague
- I call home. Short calls. We don't waste words. Family trait.
? tier>=friend
- I don't say much. Doesn't mean I'm not glad you're here. I am. Said it.   #warm

== invite
? trad:jam tier>=colleague
- Jam tonight. Come. I'll sing the right words. Someone has to.   #funny

== accept
- Yes. There.
== decline
- No. On shift. Another time.
== missed
- You didn't come. Noted. Not cross. Just noted.
== birthday
? birthday:me
- Birthday. Don't sing. If you sing, sing it right.   #funny
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. Here. A record. The words are right. I checked.   #warm
== hint
- Got a minute. Plain talk.

// Writer 3, batch 4: bubbles (smalltalk and rumour, 60 characters, said to no one in particular).

== smalltalk
- Static.
- That's not the words.   #funny
- Relay's clear. For once.
- Ask a proper question.
? act:work
- Signal's good. Next.

== rumour
- Here's the signal. Skip the static.
- Not gossip. Information.

// Writer 3, batch 5: callbacks (told: said once).

== callback
? told:fav.fetch
- You fetched it. Fast. Thanks.   #warm
? told:fav.job
- You did my job. Clean signal. Thanks.   #warm
? told:fixed.relay
- Relay's clear. No static. Was that you? Good work.
? told:came.observatory-night
- You came to observatory night. Good. Ask me which ones I've logged.
? told:gift.music
- Your record. I know all the words. The real ones. Thanks.   #warm
? told:bday
- You remembered my birthday. No static. Thanks.   #warm

// Writer 3, batch 6: your standing with their department (rep:, "this band or better") and what you're known for
// (you:), as greet lines (the head writer: the rep and knownFor kinds wait until the game calls them).

== greet
? rep:well tier>=acquaintance
- Comms hears good things about you. Clear signal. No static.
? you:chatty
- You talk to everyone. Lot of signal. Some static. Mostly signal.   #funny

// Writer 3, batch 8: thanks for a gift (gift: loved | liked | polite, or the gift's tag; dialogue 0.43.10).

== gift
? gift:loved
- Good signal. Thanks. Really.   #warm
? gift:liked
- Thanks. Useful.
? gift:polite
- Thanks. Bit of static. Kind of you, though.

// Writer 4, batch 2: everyday chatter, not about work (meals, rest days, home, hobbies, seasons, traditions).
== smalltalk
? act:meal
- Soup's fine. Not static. Fine.
- Pass the salt. Thanks.
? act:off
- Rest day. Records. Then more records.
- Called home. Clear line. Rare.
? time:evening
- That's not the words. It's "harbour", not "harder".   #funny
- Star nine hundred and something. Logged.
? time:night
- Quiet. Good. Quiet is a clean signal.
? trad:jam
- Music night. Somebody will sing it wrong. Torres.   #funny
? trad:quiz
- Song round. I'll win it. Facts.
? season:lanterns
- Lanterns. Too many lights. Nice, though.
? place:musicroom
- Side two, track three. The real words are mine.   #funny
? trad:observatory-night
- Bring your journal. Don't bring opinions.   #funny
? act:breakfast
- Breakfast. Then sleep. Don't talk to me.   #funny

== rumour
- Heard something. Not static. Real.
- Short version. You want it?

// Writer 4, batch 7: goodbyes (leaving:you), packing (leaving:soon) and letters after they've moved on.
== feel
? leaving:soon
- Packing. Records first. Then the rest.

== goodbye
? leaving:you tier>=acquaintance
- Leaving. Short version: it was good.
? leaving:you tier>=friend
- No static: you were a good shipmate. I'll remember the words to that.   #warm

== letter
- New ship. Their record cabinet's half empty. Nobody knows any words. It's very quiet. I like it. Bit.
? tier>=friend
- Star nine hundred and something. Logged. Clear signal out here. Thought you'd want to know.
